---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="id" dir="ltr">
  <head>
    <BaseHead
      title="Super Kilat — Agentic AI Professional in Indonesia"
      description="Super Kilat adalah agensi Agentic AI profesional di Indonesia. Kami membangun AI agents, workflow otomasi, dan sistem pintar dengan Hermes, OpenClaw, n8n, LangGraph, dan Claude Code."
    />
  </head>
  <body class="min-h-screen flex flex-col bg-background text-primary font-sans antialiased">
    <Header />

    <main class="flex-1">
      <!-- ─── Hero ─── -->
      <section id="beranda" class="relative pt-[162px] pb-[110px] overflow-hidden">
        <div class="absolute top-[-24%] right-[-8%] w-[700px] h-[700px] rounded-full pointer-events-none"
             style="background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(17,17,17,0.04), transparent 60%);"></div>

        <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-14 items-center relative z-[1]">
          <!-- Left: Text -->
          <div>
            <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2.5 border border-divider rounded-[12px] px-3.5 py-1.5 mb-8 text-[13px] font-mono text-secondary bg-surface-alt">
              <span class="block w-[7px] h-[7px] rounded-full bg-primary" aria-hidden="true"></span>
              Agentic AI Professional in Indonesia
            </div>

            <h1 class="font-serif tracking-[-0.03em] leading-[1.12] text-[clamp(2.2rem,5vw,3.8rem)] font-medium mb-6 text-balance"
                style="font-family: 'Newsreader', 'Instrument Serif', Georgia, serif; letter-spacing: -0.03em;">
              AI Agents yang <span class="text-secondary">Bekerja Sendiri</span>, Bukan Cuma Chatbot
            </h1>

            <p class="text-[17px] leading-[1.7] text-muted mb-8 max-w-[560px] text-pretty"
               style="font-family: 'SF Pro Display', 'Helvetica Neue', 'Switzer', system-ui, sans-serif;">
              Kami membangun sistem AI agent yang bisa merencanakan, memanggil tools, mengingat konteks, dan menyelesaikan tugas tanpa intervensi manual. Dari otomasi workflow sampai RAG enterprise.
            </p>

            <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3.5">
              <a href="#kontak"
                 class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 px-[26px] py-[15px] rounded-[6px] font-semibold text-[1rem] bg-primary text-white border border-primary transition-transform duration-150 active:scale-[0.98] hover:bg-[#333333] hover:border-[#333333]">
                Jadwalkan Konsultasi
              </a>
              <a href="#layanan"
                 class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 px-[26px] py-[15px] rounded-[6px] font-semibold text-[1rem] bg-white text-primary border border-divider hover:bg-surface-alt transition-colors duration-150">
                Lihat Layanan
              </a>
            </div>

            <p class="mt-[14px] text-[13px] text-[#a8a59d]"
               style="font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, monospace;">
              Repository open-source:
              <a href="https://github.com/zuperkilat" class="underline underline-offset-[3px]">github.com/zuperkilat</a>
            </p>
          </div>

          <!-- Right: Terminal Visual -->
          <div class="hidden lg:block">
            <div class="border border-divider rounded-[12px] p-6 bg-surface" style="box-shadow: 0 1px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.03);">
              <div class="rounded-[10px] overflow-hidden border border-divider bg-[#F7F6F3]">
                <div class="flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-3 border-b border-[#E8E8E6]">
                  <span class="w-[10px] h-[10px] rounded-full bg-[#C9C7C2]"></span>
                  <span class="w-[10px] h-[10px] rounded-full bg-[#C9C7C2]"></span>
                  <span class="w-[10px] h-[10px] rounded-full bg-[#C9C7C2]"></span>
                  <span class="ml-auto text-[13px] text-[#a8a59d] font-mono">superkilat.ai</span>
                </div>
                <div class="p-5 font-mono text-[14px] leading-[1.8] text-[#2F3437]">
                  <div class="flex gap-2.5">
                    <span class="text-primary font-semibold whitespace-nowrap">$</span>
                    <span>superkilat agent deploy --name=support-bot</span>
                  </div>
                  <div class="ml-[22px] text-muted">→ Loading skillset: customer-support, order-tracking, refund</div>
                  <div class="ml-[22px] text-muted">→ Connecting to: vector-db, CRM, WhatsApp API</div>
                  <div class="ml-[22px] text-muted">→ Agent loop: active</div>

                  <div class="flex gap-2.5 mt-3">
                    <span class="text-primary font-semibold whitespace-nowrap">$</span>
                    <span>superkilat workflow run --daily-report</span>
                  </div>
                  <div class="ml-[22px] text-[#346538]">✓ Task completed in 1.2s</div>
                  <div class="ml-[22px] text-muted">→ report sent to 14 stakeholders</div>

                  <div class="flex gap-2.5 mt-3">
                    <span class="text-primary font-semibold whitespace-nowrap">$</span>
                    <span>superkilat mcp list</span>
                  </div>
                  <div class="ml-[22px] text-muted">hermes · openclaw · n8n · langgraph · claude-code</div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- ─── Tech Logos ─── -->
      <section class="py-[56px] border-t border-divider" aria-label="Teknologi yang diakui">
        <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4">
          <p class="text-center text-muted text-[14px] mb-[26px]">Komersil dengan ekosistem yang sama yang digunakan tim AI engineering terkemuka</p>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-9 gap-y-5">
            <span class="font-semibold text-[1rem] text-[#5f6368] flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="block w-[6px] h-[6px] rounded-full bg-primary" aria-hidden="true"></span>Hermes
            </span>
            <span class="font-semibold text-[1rem] text-[#5f6368] flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="block w-[6px] h-[6px] rounded-full bg-primary" aria-hidden="true"></span>OpenClaw
            </span>
            <span class="font-semibold text-[1rem] text-[#5f6368] flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="block w-[6px] h-[6px] rounded-full bg-primary" aria-hidden="true"></span>n8n
            </span>
            <span class="font-semibold text-[1rem] text-[#5f6368] flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="block w-[6px] h-[6px] rounded-full bg-primary" aria-hidden="true"></span>LangGraph
            </span>
            <span class="font-semibold text-[1rem] text-[#5f6368] flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="block w-[6px] h-[6px] rounded-full bg-primary" aria-hidden="true"></span>Claude Code
            </span>
            <span class="font-semibold text-[1rem] text-[#5f6368] flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="block w-[6px] h-[6px] rounded-full bg-primary" aria-hidden="true"></span>Vector DB
            </span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- ─── Services / Features ─── -->
      <section id="layanan" class="py-[88px]">
        <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4">
          <div class="max-w-[720px] mx-auto mb-[52px] text-center">
            <h2 class="font-serif tracking-[-0.03em] leading-[1.1] text-[clamp(1.7rem,3.2vw,2.35rem)] font-semibold mb-3 text-balance"
                style="font-family: 'Newsreader', 'Instrument Serif', Georgia, serif; letter-spacing: -0.02em;">
              Layanan Agentic AI
            </h2>
            <p class="text-[17px] text-muted">Kami merancang, membangun, dan men-deploy AI agents yang terintegrasi dengan sistem operasional bisnis Anda.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-3.5">
            <!-- Feature Card 1 -->
            <article class="bg-surface border border-divider rounded-[12px] p-7 transition-transform duration-200 hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:shadow-[0_2px_8px_rgba(0,0,0,0.04)]">
              <div class="w-[40px] h-[40px] rounded-[8px] flex items-center justify-center bg-surface-alt border border-divider mb-5">
                <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
                  <path d="M12 8V4H8"/><rect width="16" height="12" x="4" y="8" rx="2"/><path d="M2 14h2"/><path d="M20 14h2"/><path d="M15 13v2"/><path d="M9 13v2"/>
                </svg>
              </div>
              <h3 class="text-[18px] font-semibold text-primary mb-2 leading-snug">AI Agent Development</h3>
              <p class="text-[14px] text-muted leading-relaxed">Agents dengan memory, tool calling, dan multi-step reasoning menggunakan Hermes, OpenClaw, dan LangGraph.</p>
            </article>

            <!-- Feature Card 2 -->
            <article class="bg-surface border border-divider rounded-[12px] p-7 transition-transform duration-200 hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:shadow-[0_2px_8px_rgba(0,0,0,0.04)]">
              <div class="w-[40px] h-[40px] rounded-[8px] flex items-center justify-center bg-surface-alt border border-divider mb-5">
                <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
                  <path d="M12 20h9"/><path d="M16.5 3.5a2.12 2.12 0 0 1 3 3L7 19l-4 1 1-4Z"/>
                </svg>
              </div>
              <h3 class="text-[18px] font-semibold text-primary mb-2 leading-snug">Workflow Automation</h3>
              <p class="text-[14px] text-muted leading-relaxed">Hubungkan CRM, database, WhatsApp, email, dan API pihak ketiga ke dalam pipeline otomasi yang andal.</p>
            </article>

            <!-- Feature Card 3 -->
            <article class="bg-surface border border-divider rounded-[12px] p-7 transition-transform duration-200 hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:shadow-[0_2px_8px_rgba(0,0,0,0.04)]">
              <div class="w-[40px] h-[40px] rounded-[8px] flex items-center justify-center bg-surface-alt border border-divider mb-5">
                <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
                  <circle cx="11" cy="11" r="8"/><path d="m21 21-4.3-4.3"/>
                </svg>
              </div>
              <h3 class="text-[18px] font-semibold text-primary mb-2 leading-snug">RAG & Knowledge Base</h3>
              <p class="text-[14px] text-muted leading-relaxed">Chatbot internal berbasis dokumen perusahaan dengan vector search, embedding, dan source citation.</p>
            </article>

            <!-- Feature Card 4 -->
            <article class="bg-surface border border-divider rounded-[12px] p-7 transition-transform duration-200 hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:shadow-[0_2px_8px_rgba(0,0,0,0.04)]">
              <div class="w-[40px] h-[40px] rounded-[8px] flex items-center justify-center bg-surface-alt border border-divider mb-5">
                <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
                  <path d="M14.7 6.3a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.4l1.6 1.6a1 1 0 0 0 1.4 0l3.77-3.77a6 6 0 0 1-7.94 7.94l-6.91 6.91a2.12 2.12 0 0 1-3-3l6.91-6.91a6 6 0 0 1 7.94-7.94l-3.76 3.76z"/>
                </svg>
              </div>
              <h3 class="text-[18px] font-semibold text-primary mb-2 leading-snug">Tool Calling & MCP</h3>
              <p class="text-[14px] text-muted leading-relaxed">Agen bisa memanggil function, API, database, dan layanan eksternal secara aman dan terstruktur.</p>
            </article>

            <!-- Feature Card 5 -->
            <article class="bg-surface border border-divider rounded-[12px] p-7 transition-transform duration-200 hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:shadow-[0_2px_8px_rgba(0,0,0,0.04)]">
              <div class="w-[40px] h-[40px] rounded-[8px] flex items-center justify-center bg-surface-alt border border-divider mb-5">
                <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
                  <path d="M4 14a1 1 0 0 1-.78-1.63l9.9-10.2a.5.5 0 0 1 .86.46l-1.92 6.02A1 1 0 0 0 13 10h7a1 1 0 0 1 .78 1.63l-9.9 10.2a.5.5 0 0 1-.86-.46l1.92-6.02A1 1 0 0 0 11 14z"/>
                </svg>
              </div>
              <h3 class="text-[18px] font-semibold text-primary mb-2 leading-snug">AI Infrastructure</h3>
              <p class="text-[14px] text-muted leading-relaxed">Deploy, monitoring, dan scaling LLM workloads di cloud: Cloudflare, Vercel, AWS, Docker, Kubernetes.</p>
            </article>

            <!-- Feature Card 6 -->
            <article class="bg-surface border border-divider rounded-[12px] p-7 transition-transform duration-200 hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:shadow-[0_2px_8px_rgba(0,0,0,0.04)]">
              <div class="w-[40px] h-[40px] rounded-[8px] flex items-center justify-center bg-surface-alt border border-divider mb-5">
                <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
                  <path d="M2 3h6a4 4 0 0 1 4 4v14a3 3 0 0 0-3-3H2z"/><path d="M22 3h-6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v14a3 3 0 0 1 3-3h7z"/>
                </svg>
              </div>
              <h3 class="text-[18px] font-semibold text-primary mb-2 leading-snug">AI Enablement</h3>
              <p class="text-[14px] text-muted leading-relaxed">Pelatihan tim internal, prompt engineering, evaluasi model, dan best practice production-grade AI.</p>
            </article>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- ─── Stack ─── -->
      <section id="stack" class="py-[88px] bg-surface-alt">
        <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4">
          <div class="max-w-[720px] mx-auto mb-[52px] text-center">
            <h2 class="font-serif tracking-[-0.03em] leading-[1.1] text-[clamp(1.7rem,3.2vw,2.35rem)] font-semibold mb-3 text-balance"
                style="font-family: 'Newsreader', 'Instrument Serif', Georgia, serif; letter-spacing: -0.02em;">
              Stack Teknologi
            </h2>
            <p class="text-[17px] text-muted">Kami memilih tools modern yang teruji untuk produksi, bukan hanya untuk demo.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="grid grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-3.5">
            <div class="bg-white border border-divider rounded-[10px] p-5.5 text-left hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:shadow-[0_2px_8px_rgba(0,0,0,0.04)] transition-all duration-200">
              <span class="font-semibold text-[1rem] text-primary">Hermes</span>
              <span class="block text-[13px] text-muted mt-1.5 font-medium">AI Agent Runtime</span>
              <span class="inline-block mt-2.5 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-[9999px] bg-surface-alt border border-divider text-[11px] text-muted font-mono tracking-wider">runtime</span>
            </div>

            <div class="bg-white border border-divider rounded-[10px] p-5.5 text-left hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:shadow-[0_2px_8px_rgba(0,0,0,0.04)] transition-all duration-200">
              <span class="font-semibold text-[1rem] text-primary">OpenClaw</span>
              <span class="block text-[13px] text-muted mt-1.5 font-medium">Agent Orchestration</span>
              <span class="inline-block mt-2.5 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-[9999px] bg-surface-alt border border-divider text-[11px] text-muted font-mono tracking-wider">orchestration</span>
            </div>

            <div class="bg-white border border-divider rounded-[10px] p-5.5 text-left hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:shadow-[0_2px_8px_rgba(0,0,0,0.04)] transition-all duration-200">
              <span class="font-semibold text-[1rem] text-primary">n8n</span>
              <span class="block text-[13px] text-muted mt-1.5 font-medium">Workflow Automation</span>
              <span class="inline-block mt-2.5 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-[9999px] bg-surface-alt border border-divider text-[11px] text-muted font-mono tracking-wider">workflow</span>
            </div>

            <div class="bg-white border border-divider rounded-[10px] p-5.5 text-left hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:shadow-[0_2px_8px_rgba(0,0,0,0.04)] transition-all duration-200">
              <span class="font-semibold text-[1rem] text-primary">LangGraph</span>
              <span class="block text-[13px] text-muted mt-1.5 font-medium">Multi-Agent Graphs</span>
              <span class="inline-block mt-2.5 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-[9999px] bg-surface-alt border border-divider text-[11px] text-muted font-mono tracking-wider">graphs</span>
            </div>

            <div class="bg-white border border-divider rounded-[10px] p-5.5 text-left hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:shadow-[0_2px_8px_rgba(0,0,0,0.04)] transition-all duration-200">
              <span class="font-semibold text-[1rem] text-primary">LangChain</span>
              <span class="block text-[13px] text-muted mt-1.5 font-medium">LLM Application</span>
              <span class="inline-block mt-2.5 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-[9999px] bg-surface-alt border border-divider text-[11px] text-muted font-mono tracking-wider">app</span>
            </div>

            <div class="bg-white border border-divider rounded-[10px] p-5.5 text-left hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:shadow-[0_2px_8px_rgba(0,0,0,0.04)] transition-all duration-200">
              <span class="font-semibold text-[1rem] text-primary">Claude Code</span>
              <span class="block text-[13px] text-muted mt-1.5 font-medium">AI Coding</span>
              <span class="inline-block mt-2.5 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-[9999px] bg-surface-alt border border-divider text-[11px] text-muted font-mono tracking-wider">coding</span>
            </div>

            <div class="bg-white border border-divider rounded-[10px] p-5.5 text-left hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:shadow-[0_2px_8px_rgba(0,0,0,0.04)] transition-all duration-200">
              <span class="font-semibold text-[1rem] text-primary">Vector DB</span>
              <span class="block text-[13px] text-muted mt-1.5 font-medium">Embedding Search</span>
              <span class="inline-block mt-2.5 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-[9999px] bg-surface-alt border border-divider text-[11px] text-muted font-mono tracking-wider">search</span>
            </div>

            <div class="bg-white border border-divider rounded-[10px] p-5.5 text-left hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:shadow-[0_2px_8px_rgba(0,0,0,0.04)] transition-all duration-200">
              <span class="font-semibold text-[1rem] text-primary">MCP</span>
              <span class="block text-[13px] text-muted mt-1.5 font-medium">Model Context Protocol</span>
              <span class="inline-block mt-2.5 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-[9999px] bg-surface-alt border border-divider text-[11px] text-muted font-mono tracking-wider">protocol</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- ─── Why Super Kilat ─── -->
      <section id="keunggulan" class="py-[88px]">
        <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4">
          <div class="max-w-[720px] mx-auto mb-[52px] text-center">
            <h2 class="font-serif tracking-[-0.03em] leading-[1.1] text-[clamp(1.7rem,3.2vw,2.35rem)] font-semibold mb-3 text-balance"
                style="font-family: 'Newsreader', 'Instrument Serif', Georgia, serif; letter-spacing: -0.02em;">
              Mengapa Super Kilat?
            </h2>
            <p class="text-[17px] text-muted">Kami bukan sekadar menyediakan AI. Kami membangun sistem yang benar-benar berjalan di produksi.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-10 items-start">
            <!-- Why List -->
            <div>
              <div class="flex gap-3.5 mb-4">
                <div class="w-[26px] h-[26px] rounded-full flex items-center justify-center bg-surface-alt text-primary flex-none text-[13px] border border-divider font-semibold" aria-hidden="true">✓</div>
                <div>
                  <h4 class="font-semibold text-primary mb-1 text-[15px]" style="font-family: 'SF Pro Display', 'Helvetica Neue', 'Switzer', system-ui, sans-serif;">Production-Ready</h4>
                  <p class="text-[14px] text-muted leading-relaxed m-0">Kode diuji, terdokumentasi, dan siap skala. Bukan proof-of-concept yang rusak di minggu kedua.</p>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="flex gap-3.5 mb-4">
                <div class="w-[26px] h-[26px] rounded-full flex items-center justify-center bg-surface-alt text-primary flex-none text-[13px] border border-divider font-semibold" aria-hidden="true">✓</div>
                <div>
                  <h4 class="font-semibold text-primary mb-1 text-[15px]" style="font-family: 'SF Pro Display', 'Helvetica Neue', 'Switzer', system-ui, sans-serif;">Integrasi Enterprise</h4>
                  <p class="text-[14px] text-muted leading-relaxed m-0">Terhubung ke API, database, CRM, ERP, WhatsApp, email, dan platform internal Anda.</p>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="flex gap-3.5 mb-4">
                <div class="w-[26px] h-[26px] rounded-full flex items-center justify-center bg-surface-alt text-primary flex-none text-[13px] border border-divider font-semibold" aria-hidden="true">✓</div>
                <div>
                  <h4 class="font-semibold text-primary mb-1 text-[15px]" style="font-family: 'SF Pro Display', 'Helvetica Neue', 'Switzer', system-ui, sans-serif;">Security &amp; Governance</h4>
                  <p class="text-[14px] text-muted leading-relaxed m-0">Rate limiting, access control, audit log, dan secret management menjadi standar setiap proyek.</p>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="flex gap-3.5 mb-4">
                <div class="w-[26px] h-[26px] rounded-full flex items-center justify-center bg-surface-alt text-primary flex-none text-[13px] border border-divider font-semibold" aria-hidden="true">✓</div>
                <div>
                  <h4 class="font-semibold text-primary mb-1 text-[15px]" style="font-family: 'SF Pro Display', 'Helvetica Neue', 'Switzer', system-ui, sans-serif;">Tim Ahli Lokal</h4>
                  <p class="text-[14px] text-muted leading-relaxed m-0">Tim engineer Indonesia yang memahami kebutuhan bisnis dan regulasi lokal.</p>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Metrics Visual -->
            <div class="border border-divider rounded-[12px] p-6 bg-surface min-h-[340px] flex items-center" aria-label="Metrik operasional">
              <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-3 w-full">
                <div class="bg-white border border-divider rounded-[10px] p-4 text-center">
                  <strong class="block text-[1.8rem] font-bold text-primary leading-none mb-1"
                          style="font-family: 'Newsreader', Georgia, serif;">50+</strong>
                  <span class="text-[13px] text-muted">AI Agents Deployed</span>
                </div>
                <div class="bg-white border border-divider rounded-[10px] p-4 text-center">
                  <strong class="block text-[1.8rem] font-bold text-primary leading-none mb-1"
                          style="font-family: 'Newsreader', Georgia, serif;">10x</strong>
                  <span class="text-[13px] text-muted">Faster Workflows</span>
                </div>
                <div class="bg-white border border-divider rounded-[10px] p-4 text-center">
                  <strong class="block text-[1.8rem] font-bold text-primary leading-none mb-1"
